`siteBase` reads a `$:/config/FileSystemPaths` rule, then the loci law, then TW5's flattened default through the free-or-mine uniquifier. `mirrorCarrierFiles` and `mirrorCarrierFilesAt` list the files a siting already holds. The DAM checklist (<<~ loulou uri=`lar:///ha.ka.ba/lararium/mesh/disk-projector-dam`>>) carries its observations.

